        <PAGEOBJECT XPOS="398.901392920354" YPOS="1336.29380530973" OwnPage="1" ItemID="210401328" PTYPE="4" WIDTH="284.149642477876" HEIGHT="471.504424778761" FRTYPE="0" CLIPEDIT="0" ROT="180" PWIDTH="1" PLINEART="1" LOCALSCX="1" LOCALSCY="1" LOCALX="0" LOCALY="0" LOCALROT="0" PICART="1" SCALETYPE="1" RATIO="1" COLUMNS="2" COLGAP="7.2" AUTOTEXT="0" EXTRA="0" TEXTRA="0" BEXTRA="0" REXTRA="0" VAlign="0" FLOP="1" PLTSHOW="0" BASEOF="0" textPathType="0" textPathFlipped="0" path="M0 0 L284.15 0 L284.15 471.504 L0 471.504 L0 0 Z" copath="M0 0 L284.15 0 L284.15 471.504 L0 471.504 L0 0 Z" gXpos="258.3528" gYpos="280.773484955748" gWidth="0" gHeight="0" LAYER="0" NEXTITEM="-1" BACKITEM="-1">
            <StoryText>
                <DefaultStyle LINESP="10" FONT="Bell MT Regular" FONTSIZE="9"/>
                <ITEXT FONT="Bell MT Bold" CH="Violet R. Blu"/>
                <para ALIGN="1" LINESP="10"/>
                <ITEXT FONT="Bell MT Italic" CH="Celebrated Celibate"/>
                <para ALIGN="1" LINESP="10"/>
                <para ALIGN="1" LINESP="10"/>
                <ITEXT CH="    Picture this: you go to the bar on a Friday night, and all the girls there are having a great time. They’re laughing, dancing, maybe even falling in love. Disgusting. There’s nothing worse than watching a woman have fun at the bar. Luckily for humanity, I’ve dedicated my life to preventing this tragedy. I believe every woman deserves to go home alone and furious. If you feel the same way, pay close attention to my techniques. "/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="Mario’s, Friday at 10pm"/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="(I run up to a random unsuspecting girl, yelling and flailing my arms in the air.)"/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="Blu: WEE WOO! WEE WOO! WEE WOO!"/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="Random Girl: What the fuck is happening?"/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="Blu: WEE WOO! UGLY ALARM!"/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="Random Girl: Fuck you!"/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="Blu: WEE WOO! SENSITIVE ALARM!"/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="Random Girl: You’re an asshole."/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="Blu: I’m not an asshole, I’m a person! "/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="(I point at myself.)"/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="Blu: WEE WOO! FUNNY ALARM!"/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="(She opens her phone and calls an Uber, ready to return to her miserable hovel. I give myself a high-five, which is also clapping for myself. Another job well done.)"/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="(But the night doesn’t end there.)"/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="Mario’s, Friday at 10:02pm"/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="(I walk up behind a woman standing at the bar. I take high, jolly steps and sing to myself in an impish voice.)"/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="Blu: By Mother Goose’s silver gullet, I’m gonna steal this lady’s wallet!"/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="(She turns around.)"/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="Woman: No you’re not."/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="(She goes for the door. I stand in front of her.)"/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="Blu: You can only leave without a fee if you can solve my riddles three!"/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="Woman: Wait, now I’m curious. Give me a riddle."/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="Blu: What has two thumbs in the morning and two thumbs in the evening?"/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="Woman: A person?"/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="Blu: Wrong! A monkey! I never said the thumbs had to be opposable, twat! Now give me your money!"/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="(She sprays me with mace. I cry, mostly from the mace, but also from the joy of seeing a woman unhappy.)"/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="(The night still isn’t over.)"/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="Mario’s, Friday at 10:04pm"/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="(I walk up to a girl smoking outside the establishment.)"/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="Blu: Are you from Virginia?"/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="Human Ashtray: What?"/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="Blu: Cause you’re the only virgin I, uh, see."/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="Human Ashtray: Are you putting me down?"/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="Blu: YES! YES I AM! Finally, someone appreciates my craft!"/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="Human Ashtray: That’s kinda sexy."/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="Blu: …"/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="(She hands me her cigarette.)"/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="Human Ashtray: Put this out on my tits. "/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="Blu: Nuh uh!"/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="(I swallow the lit cigarette and puke on her shoes.)"/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="Human Ashtray: That was hot as fuck. "/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="Blu: NOOOOOOOOOO!"/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="(Overcome with despair, I drop to my knees.)"/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="Human Ashtray: Ew. Get up. I thought you were gonna be the dom. "/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="(I stand up and immediately launch into a cartwheel. Another job well done.)"/>
                <para/>
                <para/>
                <para/>
            </StoryText>
        </PAGEOBJECT>
