        <PAGEOBJECT XPOS="114.4782" YPOS="1762.46870088496" OwnPage="2" ItemID="212552208" PTYPE="4" WIDTH="280.071221238938" HEIGHT="572.511504424774" FRTYPE="0" CLIPEDIT="0" PWIDTH="1" PLINEART="1" LOCALSCX="1" LOCALSCY="1" LOCALX="0" LOCALY="0" LOCALROT="0" PICART="1" SCALETYPE="1" RATIO="1" COLUMNS="2" COLGAP="7.2" AUTOTEXT="0" EXTRA="0" TEXTRA="0" BEXTRA="0" REXTRA="0" VAlign="0" FLOP="1" PLTSHOW="0" BASEOF="0" textPathType="0" textPathFlipped="0" path="M0 0 L280.071 0 L280.071 572.512 L0 572.512 L0 0 Z" copath="M0 0 L280.071 0 L280.071 572.512 L0 572.512 L0 0 Z" gXpos="114.4782" gYpos="930.465500884942" gWidth="0" gHeight="0" PSTYLE="Default Paragraph Style" LAYER="0" NEXTITEM="-1" BACKITEM="-1">
            <StoryText>
                <DefaultStyle PARENT="Default Paragraph Style" LINESP="10" FONT="Bell MT Regular" FONTSIZE="9" KERN="0" LANGUAGE="en_US"/>
                <ITEXT FONT="Bell MT Bold" FONTSIZE="9" CH="Handy Manny"/>
                <para PARENT="Default Paragraph Style" ALIGN="1" LINESP="10"/>
                <ITEXT FONT="Bell MT Italic" FONTSIZE="9" KERN="0" CH="Active Sex-Haver Extraordinaire "/>
                <para PARENT="Default Paragraph Style" ALIGN="1" LINESP="10"/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="    AB is bringing back its premier event: Sex Week! Originally hosted jointly by the Women's Center and AB Special Events, AB has since divorced the Women's Center and is now uniting with the esteemed Kenneth C. Griffin School of Computer Science. In the spirit of this sacred union, AB will be hosting a daily 7:00 P.M. event in McConomy Auditorium (except for Tuesday's special event) celebrating God's favorite pastime."/>
                <para/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT FONT="Bell MT Bold" CH="Monday: Live Sex Demonstration "/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="    Kicking things off with a bang, AB will be hosting an in-person demonstration on how to have sex. At CMU, we understand many of you may have never heard of sex. AB will be sure to go over the whole process, with special attention to awkward propositions and telling anyone you can that you are, in fact, no longer a virgin. Bring your friends, enemies, and everyone in between to witness a life-changing experience, raw and unfiltered. (Note: event duration is dependent on Jack’s stamina. Lock in, Jack.)"/>
                <para/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT FONT="Bell MT Bold" CH="Tuesday: Build Your Own Sex-Bot, powered by Roboclub "/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="    In this special event, join Roboclub in the UC Basement and work with Roboclub tools and mentors to build your very own personal sex doll! Beginner’s kits provided; all experience levels welcome. Choose your favorite customizations from prebuilt modules, like circumsized or light-medium bush. Bring a list of your craziest kinks, wishes, and desires, and Roboclub will help make your dreams a reality! (Note: If you represent a company interested in partnering professionally with Roboclub, for sex projects or otherwise, contact them via officers@roboclub.org)"/>
                <para/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT FONT="Bell MT Bold" CH="Wednesday: Sex-Engine Optimization, with OnlyFans"/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="    Struggling to land a summer internship? Looking to build your own business? OnlyFans media designers and insider consultants will be detailing all the best tips and tricks to boost your OF SEO. If you have never heard of any of those letters, don't worry! Our sexperts will teach you not only what the act of intercourse is, but how to turn any object into something sexy! Time will be available after the presentation for light networking; prepare your resumes and lingerie."/>
                <para/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT FONT="Bell MT Bold" CH="Thursday: Speed-Fucking"/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="    Want to actually meet hot singles in your area? Come to the sex week speed-fucking event, and we will have you making love to a total stranger in no time! Our expert matchmakers will rapidly assign you to the person in the room you coincidentally find least attractive, and watch as you nerds awkwardly fumble around with each other’s genitals. We will provide complimentary sex-coaches-in-training, as a voice of support and to overpraise your educational journey - after all, experiential learning is very important! If you prefer not to be coached during the act itself, we will do our best to take your preferences into account."/>
                <para/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT FONT="Bell MT Bold" CH="Friday: Abortion Options on SHIP, presented by Planned Parenthood"/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="    After your nonstop fucking fun week, join Planned Parenthood and learn what options you have in the extremely unlikely scenario that you need an abortion! They will review the options and costs for getting an abortion, from pills to coathangers. If you are a frequent sex-haver, you may even be interested in Planned Parenthood's subscription service, which provides unlimited abortions a month for one low fee!"/>
                <para/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="Please send questions or comments to: women@andrew.cmu.edu."/>
                <para/>
                <para/>
                <para/>
            </StoryText>
        </PAGEOBJECT>
